usage: release_status.py [-h] [--run-required] [--content-only]
                         [--candidate-sha CANDIDATE_SHA] [--json]

The single authoritative release-readiness decision. Detail tools report
provenance and adjudication facts. Only this command may combine those facts
with the required test results and the exact candidate artifact identity and
emit release_ready.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --run-required
  --content-only        Check content prerequisites only; never reports final
                        readiness.
  --candidate-sha CANDIDATE_SHA
  --json
